      <column caption='ANALYSIS CONTROL INVENTORY GAP LEVEL 2' datatype='string' name='[ANALYSIS CONTROL INVENTORY GAP LEVEL 1 (copy)_668221628890050570]' role='dimension' type='nominal'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='case [Parameters].[ANALYSIS.VIEW.INVENTORYGAP LEVEL 1 (copy)_668221628889935881]&#10;when &apos;GLOBAL&apos; THEN &apos;GLOBAL&apos;&#10;when &apos;REGION&apos; THEN [region]&#10;when &apos;ENTITY&apos; THEN [management_entity]&#10;when &apos;SUB ENTITY&apos; THEN [sub_entity]&#10;when &apos;CITY&apos; THEN [right_restaurant_city]&#10;WHEN &apos;REVIEW BUCKET&apos; THEN [review_bucket]&#10;WHEN &apos;COMPETITOR SOURCE&apos; THEN [right_lead_source]&#10;WHEN &apos;SF STATUS&apos; THEN [sf_status]&#10;WHEN &apos;GAP TYPE&apos; THEN [gap_type]&#10;end' />
      </column>
      <column caption='DH vendors Latest Compared to Previous' datatype='real' default-format='p0.00%' name='[Calculation1]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='(ZN(SUM([DH_vendors])) - LOOKUP(ZN(SUM([DH_vendors])), -1)) / ABS(LOOKUP(ZN(SUM([DH_vendors])), -1))'>
          <table-calc ordering-type='Rows' />
        </calculation>
      </column>
      <column caption='Last' datatype='boolean' name='[Calculation_2581899643802955776]' role='measure' type='nominal'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='LAST()=0'>
          <table-calc ordering-type='Rows' />
        </calculation>
      </column>
      <column caption='DH vendors param' datatype='string' name='[Calculation_2581899643826495509]' role='dimension' type='nominal'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='&apos;DH VENDORS&apos;' />
      </column>
      <column caption='Match Event Date : Card Filter' datatype='boolean' name='[Calculation_668221628535177217]' role='dimension' type='nominal'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='[match_event_date] = {FIXED : MAX([match_event_date])}' />
      </column>
      <column caption='Index' datatype='boolean' name='[Calculation_668221628535881730]' role='measure' type='nominal'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='LAST() &lt; 3'>
          <table-calc ordering-type='Rows' />
        </calculation>
      </column>
      <column aggregation='CountD' caption='VIEW CONTROL.INVENTORYGAP' datatype='string' name='[Calculation_668221628547776519]' role='dimension' type='nominal'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='[Parameters].[Parameter 1]' />
      </column>
      <column caption='ANALYSIS CONTROL INVENTORY GAP LEVEL 1' datatype='string' name='[Calculation_668221628880863240]' role='dimension' type='nominal'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='case [Parameters].[Parameter 5]&#10;when &apos;GLOBAL&apos; THEN &apos;GLOBAL&apos;&#10;when &apos;REGION&apos; THEN [region]&#10;when &apos;ENTITY&apos; THEN [management_entity]&#10;when &apos;SUB ENTITY&apos; THEN [sub_entity]&#10;when &apos;CITY&apos; THEN [right_restaurant_city]&#10;WHEN &apos;REVIEW BUCKET&apos; THEN [review_bucket]&#10;WHEN &apos;SF STATUS&apos; THEN [sf_status]&#10;end' />
